Sorry, guys.  Saved Pl6 games will not be tolerated by Pl7.  The issue
is not merely that of a few id bits.  Many of the structures changed, and
even if you got the game to open the saved game, it will crash within a
few moves.

I think that game-masters should discuss this issue with their customers.
If they have the NEWS flag on, they should put up a notice, and try to 
schedule bringing up Pl7 _with_ their customers.

In this connection, it is worth mentioning again that there will be a Pl8
in 4-6 weeks time, primarily in order to offer an even better PC overlay
package, but also to treat any bug which might show up in the recently
upgraded Amiga and Mac ports.  We hope that Pl8 _will_ indeed be the last
3.0 update (at least for a very long while :-)), and that we can then leave
you alone to enjoy the game without this loss of saved games.   

-Izchak


